WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.855
(slow dramatic music)

00:00:02.855 --> 00:00:06.500
- [Narrator] Antigua is a
beautiful town surrounded

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:07.931
by three volcanoes,

00:00:07.931 --> 00:00:11.610
one of which is still active.

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:14.050
While most might find
this location frightening,

00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:16.899
Timoteo Minas sees opportunity.

00:00:16.899 --> 00:00:17.732
To him,

00:00:17.732 --> 00:00:19.943
volcanic soil and altitude provide

00:00:19.943 --> 00:00:22.803
the perfect coffee-growing conditions.

00:00:29.617 --> 00:00:32.439
(fast Spanish music)

00:00:32.439 --> 00:00:36.106
(speaking foreign language)

00:01:11.917 --> 00:01:15.573
- [Narrator] Timoteo's
farm sits at 6,300 feet

00:01:15.573 --> 00:01:16.990
above sea level,

00:01:16.990 --> 00:01:19.288
which gives the coffee a special taste.

00:01:19.288 --> 00:01:22.955
(speaking foreign language)

00:01:36.898 --> 00:01:39.920
- [Narrator] But this
great quality doesn't come

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:41.633
without a lot of hard work.

00:01:42.643 --> 00:01:46.310
(speaking foreign language)

00:02:30.379 --> 00:02:34.049
- [Narrator] Timoteo has been
selling his coffee abroad

00:02:34.049 --> 00:02:36.463
for 12 years but takes great pride

00:02:36.463 --> 00:02:39.413
in providing beans to cafes nearby.

00:02:39.413 --> 00:02:43.080
(speaking foreign language)

00:03:22.490 --> 00:03:25.896
(slow upbeat music)

00:03:25.896 --> 00:03:26.910
- [Narrator] While the volcanic coffee

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:29.670
produced here is particularly renowned,

00:03:29.670 --> 00:03:31.778
it is also special to Timoteo.

00:03:31.778 --> 00:03:35.445
(speaking foreign language)

00:03:53.812 --> 00:03:56.812
(slow upbeat music)

